<title>NEW ZEALAND: Trustpower first half net profit rises.</title>
<headline>Trustpower first half net profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year to Sept 30</p>
<p>			   (million NZ$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			    9.25 vs 6.68</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)				 11.9 vs 11.6</p>
<p>    Div (cents)				 5.86 vs 3.2</p>
<p>    Turnover				   68.98 vs 54.30</p>
<p>    Pretax profit			    14.34 vs 10.49</p>
<p>    Tax					   5.10 vs 2.69</p>
<p>    Shares outstanding (million)	 123.9 vs 114.8</p>
<p>Dividend carries full imputation credits.</p>
<p>Pay date Dec 20</p>
<p>Reg date Dec 6</p>
<p>Ex div   Dec 9</p>
<p>Note - TrustPower Ltd is a Tauranga-based electricity supplier.</p>
</text>
